</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="err">编写一个</span><span class="n">SQL查询来报告</span> <span class="n">Person</span> <span class="err">表中每个人的姓、名、城市和状态。如果</span> <span class="n">personId</span> <span class="err">的地址不在</span> <span class="n">Address</span> <span class="err">表中，则报告为空</span>  <span class="n">null</span> <span class="err">。</span>
